      "text": "Twelve were ordained and chosen, 1 Ne. 12:7. the Lord hath ordained Apostle of the Lamb to write these things, 1 Ne. 14:25. Jacob2 is ordained after manner of God’s holy order, 2 Ne. 6:2. having authority from God, Alma1 ordained priests, Mosiah 18:18. Mosiah2 gives Alma1 power to ordain priests and teachers over every church, Mosiah 25:19. Alma2 ordained priests and teachers by laying on of hands, Alma 6:1. the Lord ordained priests after his holy order to teach people, Alma 13:1–3 (49:30). men are ordained unto high priesthood with holy ordinances, Alma 13:6–8. Nephi3 ordained men to baptize, 3 Ne. 7:25. one to be ordained to administer sacrament to people, 3 Ne. 18:5. other disciples are ordained instead of original disciples, 4 Ne. 1:14. manner of ordaining priests and teachers, Moro. 3.",
